# Every checkout gets LF, on every platform.
#
# Without this, a Windows clone with the default core.autocrlf=true checks the
# tree out with CRLF, and six suites fail there - not because the linter is
# wrong (it reports identically on CRLF input; that was measured) but because
# the harness performs string surgery on fixtures and repo files with \n-anchored
# patterns, which then match nothing. A gate that stops matching does not fail,
# it passes by checking less, so the checkout is pinned rather than the 93
# readFileSync call sites patched.
#
# This repository has particular reason to be explicit: it lints ABAP for an
# ecosystem where a changed line ending is an abapGit round-trip defect, and it
# ships .abap fixtures that stand in for real sources.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.abap  text eol=lf
*.mjs   text eol=lf
*.json  text eol=lf
*.jsonc text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
*.yml   text eol=lf
*.xml   text eol=lf
*.html  text eol=lf
*.ts    text eol=lf
*.sh    text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
